      "writtenOn": "2025-09-09T23:20:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The returned diffs will be passed to the formatters in the next CL.\n\n------------\n\nCurrently, each of formatter executors, such as _RunClangFormatDiff(), is given the upstream_commit.\n- https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/tools/depot_tools/+/main:git_cl.py;l\u003d7219\n\nThey take the upstream_commit param so that they can **internally** perform `git diff` to find the modified lines to format. (i.e., formatting changed parts only).\n- https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/tools/depot_tools/+/main:git_cl.py;l\u003d6752\n\nThe next CL will update the executors, so that they will be given the diffs, returned by this function, instead of `upstream_commit` and they won\u0027t need to run `git diffs` anymore.\n\nI split the changes into this CL and the next CL for easier code reviews.",
      "parentUuid": "739ae5ee_c20d1530",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7105,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 7105,
        "endChar": 22
      },
      "revId": "2899eeede491ca30d7382b65319822bae4879320",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
